  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3002.06 \"Hardship registration\" means a registration issued for a motor vehicle when the owner's privilege to register said motor vehicle has been suspended or revoked pursuant to RSA 261:180, III.\n\nSource. #6296, eff 7-23-96; ss by #6296, eff 7-23-96, EXPIRED: 7-23-04\n\nNew. #8181, eff 9-25-04; ss by #10085, eff 1-31-12; ss by #13279, eff 10-19-21",
